      "id": "8D-2025-0001",
      "issue_id": "I-2025-0001",
      "d1_team": ["Quality engineering", "Supplier quality", "Electrical diagnostics"],
      "d2_problem": "Both rear lamp assemblies collect condensation after rain on Nimbus 2022 vehicles built between March and August 2022. Twelve reports in twelve weeks, two repeat lamp failures, and one matching recall.",
      "d3_containment": "Inspect the lamp seal and connector on every incoming Nimbus 2022 case. Replace the gasket when water is present and record the build month.",
      "d4_root_cause_hypotheses": [
        "Lamp housing vent path is blocked by the gasket lip, so moisture cannot escape.",
        "Connector seal deforms at the harness bend and lets water track into the lamp.",
        "Supplier build variation in the lamp housing weld."
